    {
      "name": "places/ChIJj61dQgK6j4AR4GeTYWZsKWw/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kwMlYwRjNNVnBPWm1oM1ZGVlVNMWhaZW5scldtYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 months ago",
      "rating": 1,
      "text": {
        "text": "Google's customer service is almost useless when it comes to billing. I was invoiced for my Google workspace account to the wrong address. I was taxed in the wrong state. Upon noticing the incorrect invoice I contacted Google to change my address and asked that the invoice be corrected. I have spent the last several days talking to customer service and all they can say is it can't be fixed. So a giant company like Google can't void an invoice an issue a corrected invoice. It seems immoral to me that this company is excising these business practices. This was not a small bill it was for an annual account of 20 work space users. I am extremely disappointed with their business practices",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
